{"id":"aed464040ce8d4ec","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-normal-function.md","title":"Normal Ordinal Class Function (Supplement)","display":"df-normal-function — Normal Ordinal Class Function (Supplement)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-normal-function","aliases":["92-df-normal-function"],"display":"df-normal-function — Normal Ordinal Class Function (Supplement)","depends_on":["[[92-df-ordinal]]"],"source":"第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）；序数定义为本地扩展","source_status":"本地扩展，非原书 normal"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-normal-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-normal-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-normal-function — Normal Ordinal Class Function (Supplement)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）；序数定义为本地扩展"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地扩展，非原书 normal"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (total ordinal-valued class function with domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"afb378126cbf5f83\" href=\"?note=afb378126cbf5f83\" title=\"92-df-ordinal\">92-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lim}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lim}\\)</span> (limit-ordinal predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> (definition-target normal-function predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\Longrightarrow f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}f(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\Longrightarrow f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}f(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}(h)\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}(h)\\)</span> : 函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>是正规的</li>\n<li>序数正规函数严格递增并在极限序数处连续</li>\n<li>这里的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>是定义在真类<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>上的类函数，而不是以<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>为定义域的集合函数</li>\n<li>正规函数的固定点类是闭且无界的</li>\n<li>该序数概念不同于Gödel对角引理中的句子固定点</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>该序数类函数定义保留，但未在本书定位到此定义。原书 normal 指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 可证则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"BX\">\\(BX\\)</span> 可证的系统性质，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bd433626d0825ffc\" href=\"?note=bd433626d0825ffc\" title=\"92-df-normal-stable-system\">92-df-normal-stable-system</a>。序数连续性、序数固定点与句法固定点没有同名推理桥梁。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 XI 章 pp. 126–127（PDF 143–144）；序数定义为本地扩展。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"afb378126cbf5f83","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ (total ordinal-valued class function with domain $\\mathrm{Ord}$, see [[92-df-ordinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-normal-stable-system","status":"resolved","id":"bd433626d0825ffc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"该序数类函数定义保留，但未在本书定位到此定义。原书 normal 指 $X$ 可证则 $BX$ 可证的系统性质，见[[92-df-normal-stable-system]]。序数连续性、序数固定点与句法固定点没有同名推理桥梁。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lim}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}normal\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\mathrm{Normal}(f)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\alpha<\\beta\\Longrightarrow f(\\alpha)<f(\\beta)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\Bigl[\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Lim}(\\lambda)\\Longrightarrow f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}f(\\alpha)\\bigr)\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}(h)","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"BX","display":false}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"55e4f62f29657a14","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}(f)$ (normal-function predicate, see [[92-df-normal-function]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-function]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-normal-function]]"}],"outgoing":["afb378126cbf5f83","bd433626d0825ffc"]}